#: desktop.cc:674
msgid ""
"Could not logout properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace. Note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Kon nie teken af behoorlik.\n"
"Die sessie bestuurder kan nie wees geskakel. Jy kan probeer na forseer 'n "
"afskakel deur gedruk Ctrl+Alt+Backspace. Nota, egter, wat jou huidige sessie "
"sal nie wees gestoor met 'n geforseer afskakel."

